      "jp": "おいっ、そっちにはいたか！？\n他のガキらはともかく、あれだけは逃がしたらやばいぞ！",
      "jp_sha256": "0888aab144353221cf1645ccdc1ae93c302d0fb7cb2a24a6b2c95236e94427ec",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어이, 그쪽에는 있었나!?\n다른 꼬맹이들은 몰라도 그 녀석만은 놓치면 큰일이야!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 30,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3f5ccf6c8344ff7a515c8fffb65fc9f85ebc878051591628856d5c743ca25309:000000_-8755918944285785327:g0:r29",
      "row_index_0based": 29,
      "serialized_row_index": 29,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "兵士姿の男",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "おいっ、そっちにはいたか！？\n他のガキらはともかく、あれだけは逃がしたらやばいぞ！"
      ],
